WEBVTT

00:08:29.547 --> 00:08:32.299
Everyone in this room
can bet on themselves.

00:08:32.967 --> 00:08:36.136
It will typically happen
in moments of fear

00:08:36.178 --> 00:08:38.514
when you don't see the path forward.

00:08:38.556 --> 00:08:42.101
In my own experience,
it was a terrifying decision,

00:08:42.101 --> 00:08:44.520
but that will be your first clue.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:49.942
That feeling of being terrified
is your invitation to create change.

00:08:49.984 --> 00:08:51.860
You have to acknowledge those feelings,

00:08:51.902 --> 00:08:55.573
you have to brave them,
and you have to fight to move forward.

00:08:55.614 --> 00:08:57.157
It won't be easy.

00:08:57.199 --> 00:08:58.784
You will be afraid.

00:08:59.076 --> 00:09:00.828
Your voice will shake.